stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR

  [*] --> PENDING : POST /api/auth/register

  PENDING --> APPROVED : admin approves
  PENDING --> REJECTED : admin rejects

  APPROVED --> REJECTED : admin revokes
  REJECTED --> APPROVED : admin reconsiders

  state APPROVED {
    direction LR
    [*] --> Active
    Active --> Disabled : is_active = false
    Disabled --> Active : is_active = true
    Active : may sign in and use the platform
    Disabled : 403 on the next request
  }

  PENDING : login refused<br/>"your account is not approved yet"
  REJECTED : login refused<br/>every live session revoked

  note right of PENDING
    Registration does not sign anyone in.
    The account exists but cannot authenticate
    until an ADMIN reviews it; reviewed_by_id
    and reviewed_at record who decided, and when.
  end note
